#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2564_Minamizawa"
msgid "Akiyama-san! The article I wrote with your info was a huge\\r\nhit!"
msgstr "¡Oh, Akiyama-san! ¡El artículo que escribí con sus consejos del otro día fue un gran éxito!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2576_Minamizawa"
msgid "I'm gettin' a lot of thanks from guys sayin' it really\\r\nhelped 'em have a great time at the club!"
msgstr "¡Jo, jo! ¡¡Estoy recibiendo muchísimos mensajes de agradecimiento de varios chicos!! ¡¡Se lo han pasado bomba con las chicas de los clubes!!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2588_Ashibe"
msgid "And I've even improved my standing among my fellow editors!\\r\nIt's all thanks to you!"
msgstr "¡Incluso mi reputación en la editorial mejoró! ¡¡Todo gracias a usted, Akiyama-san!!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2600_Minamizawa"
msgid "I got a bonus for the article, so I had 'em throw a little\\r\nsomething extra your way. Here you go."
msgstr "También recibí un bono, así que le entregaré algo extra como muestra de mi agradecimiento."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2648_Minamizawa"
msgid "Bring us new info anytime you've got it!"
msgstr "¡Siga trayendo esos buenos consejos siempre que pueda!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2660_Ashibe"
msgid "We're counting on you!"
msgstr "¡¡Contamos contigo!!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2732_Minamizawa"
msgid "Oh, Akiyama-san. The article I wrote with your info went\\r\nover pretty well."
msgstr "Oh, Akiyama-san. El artículo que escribí con sus consejos tuvo buena acogida."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2744_Minamizawa"
msgid "There were a few little inconsistencies, but that's okay."
msgstr "Tenía uno que otro error, pero fueron cosillas sin importancia."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2756_Ashibe"
msgid "At first, I didn't know how he'd manage, but thankfully, he\\r\ncame through just fine in the end."
msgstr "Al principio, no sabía cómo iba a terminar esto, pero afortunadamente todo salió bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2768_Minamizawa"
msgid "I've already gotten paid for it. This here's your share."
msgstr "Ya recibí mi paga por el artículo. Tome, esto es para usted, Akiyama-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2816_Minamizawa"
msgid "Let's do even better next time!"
msgstr "¡Escribamos un artículo aún mejor la próxima vez!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2828_Ashibe"
msgid "You're our only hope, Akiyama-san. We're counting on you!"
msgstr "Akiyama-san, usted es nuestra única esperanza... ¡¡Contamos contigo!!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2900_Minamizawa"
msgid "Uh, truthfully, Akiyama-san... That last article was a\\r\ncomplete mess."
msgstr "Oh, Akiyama-san... El artículo que escribí el otro día fue un completo desastre..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2912_Minamizawa"
msgid "\"You call this an in-depth report!?\" That's the only kind of\\r\nfeedback I get these days..."
msgstr "\"¡¿Para ti estos son buenos consejos?!\" Fueron los únicos comentarios que recibí..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2924_Ashibe"
msgid "Hahaha... Ahem, this is no laughing matter. Do you have any\\r\nidea what happened to my reputation at work?"
msgstr "Je, je, je... esto no me causa nada de gracia. Gracias a usted, Minamisawa-san, mi reputación corre peligro."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2948_Minamizawa"
msgid "(They're not even botherin' to pay me... so I'm afraid this here is all I can give ya. Sorry, pal.)"
msgstr "(N-ni me están pagando por el artículo... me temo que esto es todo lo que puedo darle. Perdón)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2996_Minamizawa"
msgid "I'm really gonna need you to come through for me next time!\\r\nPlease! My reputation's on the line!"
msgstr "¡P-por favor, esfuércese más! ¡¡Hágame ver como todo un hombretón!! ¡¡Se lo suplico!!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3008_Ashibe"
msgid "Hahaha... Seriously. We're really counting on you."
msgstr "Je, je, je... recuerde, contamos con usted."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3080_Akiyama"
msgid "Uh, I think that's about all I can tell you."
msgstr "Mmhh, creo que eso es todo lo que puedo decirle."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3092_Minamizawa"
msgid "That's plenty! Thanks so much for all your help."
msgstr "¡Es más que suficiente! Muchas gracias por su ayuda."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3104_Ashibe"
msgid "Yes, indeed! If it weren't for your kind assistance,\\r\nMinamizawa-san would have surely been banished from the\\r\npublishing industry by now."
msgstr "En efecto... si no fuera por su increíble trabajo, Minamizawa-san ya habría sido expulsado del mundo editorial para siempre."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "3116_Minamizawa"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3128_Ashibe"
msgid "Thanks to you, I think this series will continue for quite\\r\na while."
msgstr "Gracias a Akiyama-san, parece que esta serie continuará por un largo tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3140_Ashibe"
msgid "If any of your friends frequent Kamurocho's hostess clubs,\\r\nplease do send them our way. We'll probably be back at MEB,\\r\ngathering info."
msgstr "Si alguno de tus amigos frecuenta los clubes de Kamurocho, no dudes en presentárnolos. Nosotros solemos recopilar información en el MEB, así que nos pueden encontrar allá."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3152_Akiyama"
msgid "All right. I'll be sure to do that if I get the chance."
msgstr "Si surge la oportunidad, se los haré saber."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3164_Minamizawa"
msgid "I really can't thank you enough!"
msgstr "¡No puedo agradecerle lo suficiente! ¡Graciaaaaas!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3248_Minamizawa"
msgid "Oh, Akiyama-san. Good to see you. Ready to tell me about the\\r\ngirls at Jewel and Shine?"
msgstr "Oh, Akiyama-san. Qué bueno verlo. ¿Listo para contarme algo de las señoritas de JeweL y SHINE?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3260_Akiyama"
msgid "(I haven't talked with any girls from Jewel or Shine lately...)"
msgstr "(Últimamente no he conversado con ninguna chica de JeweL o SHINE...)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3272_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm afraid I don't have any good info yet. I'll be back once\\r\nI've gotten to know somebody a little better."
msgstr "Me temo que aún no tengo suficiente información... Volveré luego de conocer mejor a alguna de las chicas."

